 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you feeling? Start fire going out of it, dry leaves and small sticks in front, then larger sticks behind. Wet sticks in middle. Yes, they roll easily and ignite well, especially if you' used them to start a fire in fire pit. Of course. I packed the marshmallows for you. Make it big enough that you' warm, but not so big that it gets out of control. Then a small fire toasting small branches of acorn trees gives warm tea. Acorn trees love the dry summers we've had. Put it out completely, not just left burning slightly. A small fire guard helps. In the morning, check for ashes of cold fire, and put it out completely if it's still burning.",
